WEBVTT

00:07.660 --> 00:09.730
Your Majesty! Your Majesty!

00:10.110 --> 00:12.810
What is it? I do not need to be
told the alarm bells are ringing!

00:13.120 --> 00:16.270
Holy Knights from Nederland
have invaded the city!

00:16.820 --> 00:18.740
Holy Knights?! What is their number?

00:18.740 --> 00:20.090
Five.

00:20.090 --> 00:22.410
Five? A mere five?

00:23.490 --> 00:26.760
Can we not simply crush such a small force?

00:27.000 --> 00:31.830
Your Majesty, given Nederland's involvement
and the reported rogue ship,

00:32.310 --> 00:35.670
we ought to consider this an
intentional infection mission.

00:37.720 --> 00:40.190
Afterward, I shall have Your Majesty

00:40.190 --> 00:43.400
take the new medicine for the
Black Death as a prophylactic.

00:43.400 --> 00:44.390
Very well.

00:44.890 --> 00:46.780
Still, I do not understand it.

00:47.830 --> 00:49.480
What is Nederland's aim in this?

00:49.960 --> 00:54.150
That nation has long since
been allied with the Empire.

00:54.150 --> 00:57.910
It has no reason to launch a surprise
attack with five holy knights alone.

00:58.680 --> 01:00.770
The previous monarch only just died.

01:00.770 --> 01:02.880
There has been no notice
abrogating the alliance.

01:04.440 --> 01:06.780
So then who is behind this?

01:07.110 --> 01:11.500
It must be someone well acquainted
with how the Black Death operates.

01:11.870 --> 01:15.210
It would take special knowledge
to set up this scheme.

01:15.690 --> 01:18.680
I take it you have someone in mind?

01:21.280 --> 01:27.970
I heard that three years ago, Nederland
engaged a certain commoner pharmaceutist.

01:28.600 --> 01:32.400
His characteristics,
and the treatments he employed,

01:32.400 --> 01:36.070
match those of an abominable
pharmaceutist I know.

01:36.350 --> 01:39.460
Would this, perchance,
be the man who was expelled

01:39.460 --> 01:41.290
from the Novalout College of Medicine?

01:41.580 --> 01:43.360
The very same.

01:45.350 --> 01:48.860
He was a brilliant pharmaceutist
who established

01:48.860 --> 01:52.720
numerous new treatment methods
and gained renown as a genius.

01:55.220 --> 02:00.300
However, at the same time, he also
conducted gruesome human experiments.

02:00.860 --> 02:05.840
He was a man remarkably lacking
in both humanity and morality.

02:07.640 --> 02:12.710
For his atrocities,
he was seized by inquisitors,

02:12.710 --> 02:17.060
had his Divine Arts sealed away,
and was cast out as a commoner.

02:17.430 --> 02:19.250
Before he was expelled,

02:19.250 --> 02:22.780
he was using large numbers of prisoners
of war to research poisons.

02:23.480 --> 02:24.740
Poisons, you say?

02:26.250 --> 02:31.510
The objects of his research included poisons
that could jump from person to person—

02:32.030 --> 02:33.940
in other words, epidemic diseases.

02:36.220 --> 02:41.020
If this individual is the same pharmaceutist
who appeared in Nederland,

02:41.020 --> 02:44.950
he might have had some involvement
with the previous monarch's demise.

02:46.240 --> 02:47.520
And who is this man, exactly?

02:50.010 --> 02:52.450
My erstwhile schoolmate...

02:52.860 --> 02:54.410
Bruno...

02:55.120 --> 02:56.860
...and seemingly admirable colleague...

02:56.860 --> 02:59.320
Do you still not see it?

02:59.320 --> 03:02.780
The beautiful truth of this world!

03:04.320 --> 03:05.850
...Camus de Sade.

03:08.570 --> 03:12.270
His is the one life I ought to have taken!

03:36.440 --> 03:42.990
<b>Parallel World Pharmacy</b>

04:45.090 --> 04:47.020
Gale of the Anemotheos!

04:50.540 --> 04:51.690
Fire!

04:57.570 --> 04:59.310
Trampling Flame!

05:05.740 --> 05:07.190
Here they come! Capture them!

05:10.160 --> 05:11.990
Holy Whirlwind!

05:17.540 --> 05:18.540
You shall not escape.

05:19.410 --> 05:20.840
Fury of the Earth!

05:26.780 --> 05:27.960
I can't move!

05:28.290 --> 05:30.410
Oh! He arrived!

05:30.410 --> 05:32.880
His Excellency, leader of the
Archdiocese of the Imperial Capital,

05:33.320 --> 05:34.840
Archbishop Salomon!

05:34.840 --> 05:37.620
The highest-ranking member
of Saint Fleuve's Temple?!

05:37.620 --> 05:38.810
Why would he show up?

05:39.370 --> 05:42.520
You who have turned against
the Temple's doctrine

05:42.520 --> 05:45.770
are no longer fit to wield the gods' arts!

05:47.530 --> 05:52.700
Accordingly, in the name of the Guardian
Deities, I strip you of your Divine Power!

06:01.340 --> 06:04.030
Lord Cédric, what should we do?

06:04.330 --> 06:07.500
This bell pattern indicates an attack.

06:17.070 --> 06:20.690
Do you think people might
be in need of medicine?

06:20.690 --> 06:22.780
There must be injured people...

06:22.780 --> 06:25.530
Y-Yes, but well...

06:25.530 --> 06:29.270
Oh! That's near Parallel World Pharmacy!

06:29.270 --> 06:31.490
And there are lots of
dangerous medicines there!

06:31.800 --> 06:33.950
And... And...

06:38.650 --> 06:42.870
If something were to happen to you,
it would grieve Lord Farma!

06:52.520 --> 06:53.460
Is that...

06:57.140 --> 06:59.140
<i>The quarantine station's been breached!</i>

07:03.150 --> 07:07.260
<i>How far? How far has the plague spread?</i>

07:12.690 --> 07:16.150
<i>Blue lights... Infections have taken root!</i>

07:18.620 --> 07:20.320
<i>Huh? What is that?</i>

07:24.750 --> 07:27.960
<i>That's not just a squirrel.
It's a flying squirrel!</i>

07:27.960 --> 07:31.160
<i>That gliding is gonna make it
much tougher to deal with!</i>

07:43.680 --> 07:44.920
<i>Bruno?</i>

07:47.150 --> 07:48.390
Father!

07:49.990 --> 07:52.410
Oh, Farma. Welcome back.

07:53.050 --> 07:54.630
How is Marseirre?

07:54.630 --> 07:58.370
I left Lady Eléonore in charge,
so it will be fine.

07:58.990 --> 08:00.070
I'm more concerned about...

08:06.650 --> 08:08.770
What was your objective?

08:08.770 --> 08:10.810
Nederland borders the Empire.

08:10.810 --> 08:13.390
Bringing the Black Death here
will doom Nederland as well!

08:16.590 --> 08:20.300
The Black... Death?
What are you talking about?

08:20.300 --> 08:23.890
What? You don't know
what it is you've done?!

08:24.390 --> 08:28.640
We just did what he told us to do.

08:28.640 --> 08:30.100
We don't know his objective.

08:30.510 --> 08:32.060
How incredibly foolish.

08:33.940 --> 08:36.540
He's holding the populace hostage.

08:36.830 --> 08:42.740
He has the power to kill thousands
of people in the blink of an eye.

08:43.270 --> 08:47.260
He's possessed. Possessed by an evil spirit!

08:48.030 --> 08:49.610
An evil spirit?

08:54.170 --> 09:00.300
This man, does he have turquoise hair,
a burn on his left cheek, and one eye?

09:02.490 --> 09:04.220
Y-Yes!

09:05.170 --> 09:10.680
We carried out our end.
Now our people can...

09:16.100 --> 09:17.570
Give them a burial.

09:17.810 --> 09:21.530
Father, you know who's behind all this?

09:23.190 --> 09:27.930
Camus de Sade. A heretical
pharmaceutist with a sick mind.

09:27.930 --> 09:31.950
So that fiend became
an evil spirit in the end.

09:42.540 --> 09:44.760
Oh! The alarm bells have stopped!

09:45.140 --> 09:47.720
Hurray! Hurray!

09:48.140 --> 09:50.470
I'm going back to the pharmacy!

09:51.100 --> 09:52.780
Hey! Come back!

09:57.120 --> 09:58.880
To deal with what's coming,

09:58.880 --> 10:01.840
I think I should go and begin
producing more of the medicine—

10:04.880 --> 10:07.580
<i>What's this ominous feeling?</i>

10:10.770 --> 10:12.600
<i>What </i>is<i> that?</i>

10:13.340 --> 10:15.120
<i>A black shadow?</i>

10:15.760 --> 10:16.730
What's wrong?

10:17.180 --> 10:19.520
I'm sorry! I need to get to my pharmacy!

10:19.520 --> 10:20.610
O-Okay...

10:21.540 --> 10:22.630
Oh, no!

10:23.030 --> 10:25.560
Don't stop the alarm!
Keep the bells ringing!

10:28.000 --> 10:30.990
<i>Camus is in the capital!</i>

10:31.840 --> 10:35.040
<i>To view the results of his experiment.</i>

10:36.670 --> 10:41.130
<i>I must strike him down,
even if he kills me in the process!</i>

10:54.840 --> 10:58.250
Oh! Master Farma must have returned!

11:04.210 --> 11:05.390
What?

11:05.840 --> 11:07.490
The alarm is sounding again!

11:08.060 --> 11:11.020
How strange... Is it another enemy?

11:12.100 --> 11:14.180
For now, let's hurry inside!

11:17.620 --> 11:18.930
Something isn't right.

11:19.370 --> 11:21.650
Neither the gate nor the door was locked...

11:22.600 --> 11:25.310
Wait, Lotte! Let me check things out!

11:32.040 --> 11:33.500
Master Farma!

11:36.800 --> 11:37.810
What?

11:37.810 --> 11:39.400
Master Farma?

11:50.810 --> 11:54.240
M-Maybe I imagined it...

11:59.030 --> 12:02.270
Lotte, I told you to wait for me.

12:09.690 --> 12:10.410
Huh?

12:35.110 --> 12:37.490
What's that? Don't tell me...

12:39.370 --> 12:42.100
Is that... an evil spirit?

12:42.100 --> 12:43.810
What's it doing in my lab?!

12:46.390 --> 12:47.500
Farma!

12:47.770 --> 12:48.960
Father!

13:02.270 --> 13:08.430
What a nasty feeling.
I sense a powerful light.

13:08.680 --> 13:10.630
Lotte! Cédric!

13:11.170 --> 13:13.100
I'll draw his attention.

13:13.100 --> 13:14.550
Use that time to help them.

13:16.510 --> 13:17.620
Here I go!

13:18.080 --> 13:19.490
Flying Frozen Bullets!

13:25.970 --> 13:27.410
It's been a while,

13:28.590 --> 13:29.600
Camus.

13:30.040 --> 13:33.740
Bruno. Have you come to interfere?

13:33.740 --> 13:35.330
How foolish.

13:35.330 --> 13:38.450
All people die eventually.

13:40.160 --> 13:42.200
And that is why people <i>live</i>.

13:42.750 --> 13:48.220
To support their bright, shining lives
is why we pharmaceutists exist!

13:48.870 --> 13:50.420
Crystalline Ice Spears!

13:52.790 --> 13:55.030
<i>What is this? What's going on?</i>

13:55.610 --> 13:56.700
<i>Poison?</i>

13:56.700 --> 13:59.200
<i>If I don't identify it soon,
it'll be too late!</i>

13:59.200 --> 14:00.660
Crystalline Ice Prison!

14:02.800 --> 14:04.070
<i>Chemical poisoning!</i>

14:05.250 --> 14:06.770
<i>An inorganic compound.</i>

14:15.370 --> 14:17.080
<i>Organic compound.</i>

14:25.670 --> 14:26.890
<i>An alkaloid.</i>

14:27.860 --> 14:31.340
<i>A fast-acting, deadly poison
easily obtained in this world...</i>

14:31.340 --> 14:32.700
<i>Aconite?</i>

14:33.950 --> 14:35.050
<i>Aconitine!</i>

14:38.600 --> 14:39.990
Eliminate aconitine!

14:42.930 --> 14:45.890
<i>Multiple poisons? How many are there?</i>

14:46.230 --> 14:51.370
<i>Tetrodotoxin, saxitoxin,
palytoxin, amanitin...</i>

14:51.370 --> 14:53.100
<i>Batrachotoxin.</i>

14:54.320 --> 14:55.290
<i>Are you kidding me?</i>

14:55.290 --> 14:57.990
E-Eliminate batrachotoxin!

15:00.700 --> 15:02.510
<i>I can't believe it was an arrow poison.</i>

15:06.380 --> 15:09.840
Bruno, why can't you see it?

15:09.840 --> 15:14.130
Ill people on their way
to death are beautiful!

15:18.280 --> 15:20.930
W-Wait! Camus!

15:22.390 --> 15:26.050
Debilitation, despair, death...

15:26.830 --> 15:32.540
And the actions of the few winners who
withstand an illness to keep life going...

15:32.540 --> 15:35.410
All of it makes humanity hardier.

15:35.990 --> 15:40.740
Therein lies the beauty of life—
its essence!

15:41.460 --> 15:44.860
This lab is wonderful.

15:45.160 --> 15:48.870
Look how many unknown poisons it contains.

15:49.060 --> 15:53.350
Now, time for humanity to
take another step forward.

15:53.660 --> 15:56.540
Time for an experiment!

15:57.590 --> 15:59.210
Eliminate white phosphorous!

16:02.640 --> 16:04.110
Oh?

16:04.590 --> 16:08.580
That is <i>not</i> what an experiment is.

16:09.630 --> 16:10.790
It's no use.

16:11.170 --> 16:12.510
Not with you...

16:13.660 --> 16:15.380
You're incurable!

16:20.680 --> 16:24.370
<i>Master Farma looks so angry.</i>

16:24.370 --> 16:27.320
<i>No... He looks, somehow,</i>

16:28.050 --> 16:29.790
<i>very sad.</i>

16:29.790 --> 16:31.750
And just what...

16:32.040 --> 16:34.010
are you going to do about it?

16:37.590 --> 16:40.560
Why? Why don't you see?

16:40.560 --> 16:45.920
How can you have so much power
and yet not appreciate my ideas?

16:46.260 --> 16:51.230
You're a seeker of truth,
like me! I know it!

16:51.230 --> 16:53.200
We're the only ones

16:53.470 --> 16:56.090
who can appreciate the truth of this world!

16:57.330 --> 17:00.670
The ordinary people
will try to get rid of you!

17:00.670 --> 17:03.290
Just as they did with me!

17:03.290 --> 17:08.210
None of them could...
Nobody could understand me!

17:10.470 --> 17:13.160
You'll eventually end up like me—

17:13.160 --> 17:17.640
an evil spirit that exists outside
the laws of the human world!

17:20.100 --> 17:21.990
Even if that's true,

17:22.800 --> 17:24.690
I choose to keep curing people!

17:34.210 --> 17:35.290
Begone!

17:58.550 --> 18:00.090
So <i>this</i>...

18:00.090 --> 18:02.110
is death.

18:13.410 --> 18:14.760
That light...

18:15.520 --> 18:18.560
Could that be... Cleansing Sanctuary?

18:19.230 --> 18:23.750
Numerous abilities appear in the legends
passed down about the Panac-rhabdos.

18:23.750 --> 18:26.720
Chief among them is the
power of purification.

18:27.210 --> 18:32.410
According to the ancient texts, the wand,
in tandem with the Panactheos's own works,

18:32.410 --> 18:36.790
destroyed the evil spirits in the air
and quelled an epidemic.

18:37.270 --> 18:39.270
So then perhaps...

18:39.270 --> 18:42.270
Yes. I expect this is
the Panactheos's power.

18:50.790 --> 18:52.830
You stupid idiot.

19:19.910 --> 19:21.750
Master Farma...

19:29.750 --> 19:31.840
Welcome back.

19:48.980 --> 19:55.190
<i>Afterward, the response to and treatment
of the Black Death continued earnestly.</i>

19:58.550 --> 20:02.670
<i>Elen's inspection of the vessels
arriving for the Saint Fleuve Fair</i>

20:02.670 --> 20:06.360
<i>completely prevented any influx
of the disease from the port.</i>

20:08.190 --> 20:12.660
<i>I produced additional doses of
levofloxacin to treat the Black Death.</i>

20:13.210 --> 20:16.240
<i>Compounding Pharmacy
Guild members carried out</i>

20:16.240 --> 20:19.740
<i>free distribution of the treatment
in contaminated districts.</i>

20:20.520 --> 20:24.380
<i>However, that didn't
mean we saved everyone.</i>

20:25.790 --> 20:27.880
<i>Some people couldn't be saved.</i>

20:47.800 --> 20:51.580
<i>Still, the capital's recovery
proceeded steadily.</i>

20:52.290 --> 20:54.880
<i>The threat of the Black Death is receding.</i>

20:55.720 --> 20:57.530
<i>At the School of Pharmacy,</i>

20:57.530 --> 21:02.760
<i>bacteria that produce streptomycin
and other antibiotics have been found,</i>

21:02.760 --> 21:06.480
<i>and they are currently in the process
of isolating and culturing them.</i>

21:08.150 --> 21:12.260
<i>At the same time, vaccine development for
all sorts of infections is proceeding as well.</i>

21:19.840 --> 21:22.920
<i>I'm sure that in the not-too-distant future,</i>

21:22.920 --> 21:26.020
<i>the Black Death will cease
to be an incurable disease.</i>

21:31.230 --> 21:33.650
<i>And now, two months later...</i>

21:41.020 --> 21:44.730
On this occasion, I declare that the
Black Death epidemic has ended!

22:02.830 --> 22:07.920
And so, starting today, Parallel
World Pharmacy resumes operation!

22:07.920 --> 22:12.070
Everyone, give me an
enthusiastic cheer! Yeah!

22:12.070 --> 22:13.380
Yeah!

22:13.380 --> 22:15.100
Y-Yeah...

22:17.290 --> 22:21.530
We were closed for far too long.
Not that we had another choice.

22:21.530 --> 22:24.610
Hopefully people didn't
forget about our shop.

22:24.610 --> 22:28.790
Yes. I pray we won't need to
have any more special closures.

22:31.670 --> 22:33.690
Hey there, Mr. Proprietor!

22:33.690 --> 22:36.960
Commodore Jean! Thanks for
your support at the port!

22:36.960 --> 22:40.040
Aw, shucks. Don't call me "Commodore."

22:42.640 --> 22:44.840
It's been so long since
we've seen all of you!

22:44.840 --> 22:48.210
Hey there, Lotte! I missed seeing you.

22:48.210 --> 22:51.170
Here you go! A souvenir from the Fair.

22:52.450 --> 22:54.420
Thank you very much!

22:54.420 --> 22:56.180
Now then, allow me to perform...

22:56.180 --> 22:57.910
my dance of gratitude!

22:58.610 --> 23:03.890
Though it was delayed, it's thanks to you
that the Fair could be held at all, Farma.

23:03.890 --> 23:05.660
Another impressive performance!

23:05.660 --> 23:07.780
No, it was because everyone worked together.

23:07.780 --> 23:10.880
Oh, don't be so modest! Come on!

23:14.370 --> 23:15.880
Coming!

23:31.860 --> 23:35.740
Please come in! Welcome to
Parallel World Pharmacy!
